    {
      "id": "claim_da9da96b00874ad5b57c1c10d6682932",
      "statement": "CustomJwtAuthMiddleware authenticates each request. It reads the access_token cookie or Bearer token. Expired tokens return 498 and other invalid tokens return 401. It rejects JTIs blacklisted in Redis. It loads the OrgUser (optionally narrowed by the x-dalgo-org header), resolves role permission slugs from Redis (rebuilding from RolePermission on a cache miss), and sets request.orguser, request.permissions and request.token.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/auth.py#L154-L260",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3ec2a909a0fedb66552475c03b9f7e3bc1afe7e0ec5b399569928196f23b2639:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_83a7a0e7a9994375bb9acc38fdc50334",
      "statement": "has_permission requires request.permissions to be a superset of the listed slugs. Its bare except converts any denial, including the inner 403, into HttpError(404, 'unauthorized'). The decorator preserves async views via an async wrapper so Ninja awaits them, which a regression test covers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/auth.py#L41-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:317a6ad3c29501e185a3b775f99cfebf2efd56e9135f379b2e4ba116c8135364:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/tests/api_tests/test_has_permission_async.py#L1-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:49ebf23ba4d2c4c757637a009afefc75136e0ee28785d95ccb1772cf697434a2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5782c4f6045640c48a851458df91773f",
      "statement": "has_access is a resource-level gate stacked under has_permission. It resolves the caller's access level on a resource through access_control. A missing or cross-org resource returns 404, no access or insufficient level returns 403, and the granted level is stored on request.access_level.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/api/kpi_api.py#L113-L125",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f4809bf84d3e1eccdc4fd7e0e0755ed9eca4cbcdec2e085a15b0795a39c5643d:"
        },
        {
