      "statement": "src_api registers global exception handlers. Ninja request ValidationError returns 422 with detail, Pydantic ValidationError returns 500, and any other Exception returns 500 with str(exc). Core code raises domain exceptions that the API layer maps to HttpError (for example the Pipeline*Error classes map to 400, 422, 404 and 500 in pipeline_api).",
