    {
      "id": "claim_b2279fae59cc4ae89bc334d3b71a1c44",
      "statement": "Multi-tenancy is enforced in services by filtering every query on the org derived from request.orguser.org, never a client-supplied org id. PipelineService, for example, queries OrgDataFlowv1 and OrgTask with org=org. The framework does not enforce this, so a missing filter would leak data across tenants.",
