    {
      "id": "claim_9a9b8d2a461d46b9ab509dac92e9c035",
      "statement": "Parts of the code base deviate from the written invariants. pipeline_api imports OrgTask and ConnectionMeta and queries them in the API layer, and calls prefect_service and airbyte_service directly. Several models still define to_json. extra=\"forbid\" is used on only a few schemas (KPIExtraConfig and the OAuth state, token and ref schemas), and ddpprefect/schema.py does not set it.",
